# gradle-wrapper.jar

This directory should contain gradle-wrapper.jar (the Gradle wrapper bootstrap JAR).

In a normal gradle setup, this file is binary and checked into version control for offline builds.

For this project, the JAR is not included. To generate it locally:

```bash
gradle wrapper --gradle-version 8.10
```

This will create gradle-wrapper.jar from the gradle distribution specified in gradle-wrapper.properties.

Alternatively, the Gradle wrapper can bootstrap itself from the network on first run.
